\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Galactic Empire</strong>\n                    <span>The Galactic Empire, also known as the First Galactic Empire, the Imperial regime, Palpatine&#039;s regime, or simply the Empire, and later as the Old Empire, was a fascist and imperialist dictatorship that replaced the…</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/the-force\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            The Force\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Force is central to Star Wars mythology.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/jedi-order\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Jedi Order\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Jedi are central to Star Wars.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Galactic Empire\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Empire defines the original saga conflict.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Created By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Created By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/george-lucas\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            George Lucas\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>George Lucas created Star Wars.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Produced By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Produced By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/lucasfilm\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Lucasfilm\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Lucasfilm produces Star Wars.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Star Wars is also referenced as SW.</li><li>George Lucas created Star Wars.</li><li>The Force is central to Star Wars mythology.</li><li>The Jedi are central to Star Wars.</li><li>A New Hope is a core Star Wars film.</li><li>Evidence around Star Wars is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sources\">\n    <h2>Sources &amp; further reading</h2>\n    <p><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Fandom wiki</a></p>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Star Wars?</h2>\n\n    <p>\n        <strong>Star Wars</strong> is a space-fantasy franchise created by\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/george-lucas\" class=\"entity-link\">George Lucas</a>\n        and produced by\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/lucasfilm\" class=\"entity-link\">Lucasfilm</a>.\n        It began with\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/movies/a-new-hope\" class=\"entity-link\">A New Hope</a>\n        in 1977 and expanded into prequels, sequels, and standalone stories.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        At its heart is\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/the-force\" class=\"entity-link\">the Force</a>\n        and the conflict between the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/jedi-order\" class=\"entity-link\">Jedi Order</a>\n        and the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/sith\" class=\"entity-link\">Sith</a> —\n        from\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/jedi-order/anakin-skywalker\" class=\"entity-link\">Anakin Skywalker</a>\n        and\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire/darth-vader\" class=\"entity-link\">Darth Vader</a>\n        to\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/rebel-alliance/luke-skywalker\" class=\"entity-link\">Luke Skywalker</a>,\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/rebel-alliance/leia-organa\" class=\"entity-link\">Leia Organa</a>,\n        and\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/resistance/rey\" class=\"entity-link\">Rey</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        Empires rise and fall around that struggle: the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-republic\" class=\"entity-link\">Galactic Republic</a>,\n        the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire\" class=\"entity-link\">Galactic Empire</a>,\n        the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/rebel-alliance\" class=\"entity-link\">Rebel Alliance</a>,\n        the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/first-order\" class=\"entity-link\">First Order</a>,\n        and the\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/resistance\" class=\"entity-link\">Resistance</a>.\n    </p>\n</section>","word_count":1079,"uniqueness_score":"1.0000"},"entity":{"id":"b9264011-42a7-4167-bf48-30674bdcc835","name":"Star Wars","slug":"star-wars","type":"work","kind":"series","type_label":"Series","short_description":"Star Wars is a multi-genre multimedia franchise created by George Lucas. After the publication of the novel Star Wars: From the Adventures of Luke Skywalker in 1976 and the release of the original theatrical live-action…","description":"Star Wars is a multi-genre multimedia franchise created by George Lucas. After the publication of the novel Star Wars: From the Adventures of Luke Skywalker in 1976 and the release of the original theatrical live-action film Star Wars in 1977, the franchise has expanded into a vast fictional storytelling universe comprising of feature films, television series, video games, novels, short stories, comic books, merchandise and other multimedia projects, resulting in a developed expanded universe. It is heavily inspired by archetypes and motifs from classical mythology, religion, political history, and the \"hero's journey.\"\n\nRecognized as a defining example of the epic space opera subgenre of science fiction, Star Wars has become one of the most successful and influential multimedia franchises in history, becoming embedded in global pop culture and ranking among one of the highest-grossing properties. The franchise is owned by Lucasfilm, and by extension The Walt Disney Company, following their purchase of Lucasfilm and the Star Wars franchise from Lucas in 2012.\n\nThe core foundation of the Star Wars story is the Skywalker Saga, a series of nine episodic films released with the original Star Wars film in 1977 and ending with the ninth film in 2019. The saga follows three generations of the Skywalker family in three trilogies across several galactic conflicts. Beyond this, Star Wars has expanded through other media, with the Star Wars Legends continuity comprising of media beyond the Skywalker saga prior to the April 2014 continuity reset, and new expanded universe stories falling under one unified canon. In recent years, the Star Wars franchise has significantly expanded with the development and release of spin-off theatrical films, new television series, and large-scale publishing initiatives.\n\nThe Star Wars story has been presented in a series of American films, which have spawned a large quantity of books and other media, which have formed the Expanded Universe. The Star Wars mythos is also the basis of many toys and games of varying types. The films and novels employ common science-fiction motifs.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"star-wars","aliases":["Star Wars","SW"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/c/cc/Star-wars-logo-new-tall.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20190313021755","image_source":"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Wookieepedia (Star Wars Fandom). Character / franchise art © Lucasfilm Ltd. / Disney (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Star Wars"},"connections":[],"rabbit_holes":[],"copyright":{"theme":"star-wars","title":"STAR WARS is not owned by Ton-o-Lore.","body":"STAR WARS and all related characters, names, marks, and images are trademarks of Lucasfilm Ltd. and/or Disney. Ton-o-Lore is an independent, unofficial fan and informational project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Lucasfilm, Disney, or their rights holders. Identification thumbnails, when shown, are low-resolution images used under a fair-use rationale for commentary and identification only — not free or redistributable artwork. Character details and identification thumbs may be sourced from Wookieepedia (starwars.fandom.com)."},"subject":{"id":"star-wars","name":"Star Wars","theme":"star-wars","path":"/star-wars","logo":{"license":"fair_use","usage":"fair_use_identification","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Star_wars2.svg/330px-Star_wars2.svg.png","alt":"Star Wars logo","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Wars","credit":"Fair-use identification logo via Wikipedia / Wikimedia Commons. © Lucasfilm Ltd. / Disney."},"categories":["movies","television","video-games"]}}